The '''Pantora tea parlor'''<ref name="EG">{{SW|url=series/the-bad-batch/infiltration-episode-guide|text="Infiltration" Episode Guide &#124; Star Wars: The Bad Batch}}</ref> was a [[tea]] parlor on [[Pantora]] used for a [[Riyo Chuchi and Avi Singh's secret meeting|secret meeting]] between [[Senator]]s [[Riyo Chuchi]] and [[Avi Singh]]<ref name="Infiltration" /> during or after [[18 BBY]].<ref name="TBBS3Date">{{TBBDate|306}}</ref> It was infiltrated by [[CX-1]], who tried to assassinate Singh. However, he was stopped by [[Rex]], who was acting as security. Rex managed to throw the [[bomb]] aimed for Singh at the wall before it detonated, damaging the parlor but leaving the senators unharmed.<ref name="Infiltration" />

